# Dup Finder core

- Stack: Rust engine; CLI then Tauri+React GUI then daemon; BLAKE3 content identity; MIME sniff ignores extension.
- Delivery: portable binary + OS packages + Docker; Docker is also the primary test matrix on Mac.
- Scale: design for multi-TB; prove A → B → C in benchmarks before claiming done.
- Quality: performance + security/compliance + UAT before advancing slices.
- Prefer graphify when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists; keep diffs minimal; no AI attribution in git.
